              <li>Outdoor visitor areas</li>
              <li>Food and refreshments</li>
              <li>Optional activities</li>
              <li>Special programmes</li>
            </ul>

            <p class="text-slate-700 text-[16px] leading-relaxed">
              This is one reason travelers who want a more expansive Cu Chi experience may prefer to allocate additional time for Ben Duoc. Additional areas or programmes should be treated separately from the basic 135,000 VND international visitor charge unless specifically stated otherwise.
            </p>
