            <p class="text-slate-700 text-[16px] leading-relaxed">
              This means that travelers should plan the entire excursion around the opening hours rather than treating 5:00 PM as simply the time they need to leave Ho Chi Minh City. If you are visiting independently, allow enough buffer for travel from your hotel, traffic, ticket purchase, the site visit, and return transportation.
            </p>
            <p class="text-slate-700 text-[16px] leading-relaxed">
